{"id":"5141","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5141_main_cirrostratus-fibratus-duplicatus-undulatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张图片显示了从北方（图像的右侧）漂移的该位置的波状复云性毛卷层云，几乎是阴天的双层云巾。双面云巾（复云云类）由较高的白色云层以及较低的云层组成，较高的云层在南侧（左侧）具有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横波</span>（波状云云类），而较低的云层在出现<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴影</span>的地平线附近特别明显。</p>\n<p>还存在若干凝结尾迹（例如，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span> 和 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处）。</p>\n<p>高压系统使得整个地区保持了良好的天气。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国Bad Kreuznach","latitude":"纬度: 49° 50' 39'' N","longitude":"经度: 7° 50' 32'' E","date":"07 April 2015 1854 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: P.3.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.3.4"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5141_syn_cirrostratus-fibratus-duplicatus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>表面图表显示了照片拍摄后一小时的情况。该地区受到反气旋影响，对流层低层有相对较冷的空气和微风。北欧由复杂的低压系统占主导，其包括一系列弱化的锢囚锋和三相点锋（暖锋、锢囚锋和冷锋的交界处）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5141_upper_cirrostratus-fibratus-duplicatus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测是6小时之前，上游200公里处（东 - 东-北）。它被认为可代表拍摄图像时德国Bad Kreuznach的条件，并显示7800至9200米的水分含量较高。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5141_sat_cirrostratus-fibratus-duplicatus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>卫星图片显示了照片拍摄前两小时的情况。在大型高压系统的影响下，中欧和西欧大部天空晴朗。在北欧，锋面云带向南流动。德国西北部受到高层云的影响。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2014","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}